cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this architecture, please cite it."
title: "Ephemeral Cognition, Persistent Continuation: A Cognitive Interrupt Architecture for Durable AI Workflows"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Voulez"
    given-names: "Dan"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A spec-first architecture for durable AI workflows in which deterministic
  software owns continuity and external cognition is invoked only at typed
  semantic gaps. The reference realization combines Google ADK, Jev/TypeSafe
  System One, and Braintrust.
keywords:
  - cognitive interrupts
  - durable workflows
  - ephemeral cognition
  - AI orchestration
  - LLM agents
  - Google ADK
  - Jev
  - Braintrust
repository-code: "https://github.com/danvoulez/cognitive-interrupt-engine"
